{"id":5428,"date":"2025-09-17T22:45:15","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T15:45:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5428"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:21:01","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:21:01","slug":"phi-san-tiktok","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/phi-san-tiktok\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt ph\u00ed s\u00e0n TikTok m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n nay v\u00e0 c\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c t\u00ednh"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"IVrtdPhjMo56Msxmzpxlif3IgRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEE5dmMOdo1mccxBXFPlFChUgMh\">Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i chi ph\u00ed ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 s\u1ed1ng c\u00f2n gi\u00fap nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop \u0111\u1ecbnh gi\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn. T\u1eeb th\u00e1ng 7 n\u0103m 2025, TikTok Shop s\u1ebd c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt quan tr\u1ecdng v\u1ec1 bi\u1ec3u ph\u00ed, \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ph\u1ea3i n\u1eafm v\u1eefng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ednh to\u00e1n chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. Vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd ch\u1eb7t ch\u1ebd c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed n\u00e0y l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u1ec3 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n h\u01a1n, s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u01b0 <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf l\u1edbn. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y s\u1ebd t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ea5t c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed s\u00e0n TikTok b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xw9DdCumtoQKkBxjV80lgNDogqb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EaL6dIgIpoauxxxxT59lWB9SgMl\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2\">T\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed s\u00e0n TikTok Shop nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3<\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H2s6d6c9UoLs9QxXMEYli5LWgfh\">Khi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, c\u00f3 hai lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh m\u00e0 m\u1ecdi nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec1u ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 tr\u00ean m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng: <strong>Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng<\/strong> v\u00e0 <strong>Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch<\/strong>. Ngo\u00e0i ra, s\u1ebd c\u00f3 c\u00e1c chi ph\u00ed kh\u00e1c ph\u00e1t sinh t\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c kinh doanh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng (C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt T7\/2025)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwBAdRgGLoOMesxcxBulgbuBgCd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-EaX6deYb1oWM7bxCiQhlroHLgRc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2500508c-a878-46e7-b6fa-8c39fb18426b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKDbVbOyCZo1us2xAlZElw2qRg3g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KDbVbOyCZo1us2xAlZElw2qRg3g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:487112,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5429\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5429\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5429\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-24.png\" alt=\"Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng (C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt T7\/2025)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-24.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-24-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-24-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-24-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-24-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5429\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng (C\u1eadp nh\u1eadt T7\/2025)<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tmowdy7hzoGcy7xqhVplufzwgRe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YZZkdrS2Yo4DvoxFUEKljMSVgYd\">\u0110\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kinh doanh tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TM\u0110T n\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i thanh to\u00e1n ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng cho n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng \u0111\u00f3, TikTok c\u0169ng kh\u00f4ng ngo\u1ea1i l\u1ec7, sau \u0111\u00e2y h\u00e3y c\u00f9ng Lemon Digital t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u v\u1ec1 ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TM\u0110T c\u00f3 th\u1ecb ph\u1ea7n l\u1edbn th\u1ee9 hai t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-BT8hd6n3aotEJgx1RXzlYna3g5N\">Ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SkbvdLnAwoDYofxZtRblYLfsgmf\">Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng (hay c\u00f2n g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 Ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh) l\u00e0 kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed m\u00e0 TikTok Shop thu c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ec3 duy tr\u00ec, v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng. Ph\u00ed n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m sau khi \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1eeb \u0111i c\u00e1c khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i do nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng t\u00e0i tr\u1ee3.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Drg7doErGocIkaxK1LMll349gxe\"><strong>C\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c: <\/strong>Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng = (Gi\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m &#8211; Khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i c\u1ee7a Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng) x T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KsuQdco5qou0WNxrOiTlzwBGgpg\"><strong>B\u1ea3ng ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t (\u00e1p d\u1ee5ng t\u1eeb 18\/07\/2025)<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TopFd00bRotEQMxLwBTlPvAGg5e\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5431\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5431\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5431\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-26.png\" alt=\"B\u1ea3ng ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t (\u00e1p d\u1ee5ng t\u1eeb 18\/07\/2025)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-26.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-26-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-26-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-26-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/1280X1280-26-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5431\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u1ea3ng ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t (\u00e1p d\u1ee5ng t\u1eeb 18\/07\/2025)<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"IVrtdPhjMo56Msxmzpxlif3IgRd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-JTO9d6tDZodNMTxnaUGlo3h6gtc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b3a23ae9-63fc-4436-adfc-8fae6116b4a4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FODmfbKwX0oX06FxVhPVlddSHgjh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ODmfbKwX0oX06FxVhPVlddSHgjh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:201840,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I2yKdLHRzoz3NPxPCEHlKoxegIe\"><strong>Chi ti\u1ebft v\u1ec1 nh\u1eefng thay \u0111\u1ed5i chi ph\u00ed TikTok Shop xem <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/drive\/folders\/1qGfhVLKET0F6FL89TT62GrV1H62kIKEf?hl=vi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T\u1ea0I \u0110\u00c2Y<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T8And9nCJoCFAExt01VlXdrVgPv\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JpbZdhBvooVxNGxpd0zlElwBg9b\">TikTok Shop \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng kh\u00e1c nhau cho t\u1eebng ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 lo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n (Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 TikTok Shop Mall).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PEUFdPeJFoNKKUxsQ5ilqdclgqZ\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd quan tr\u1ecdng:<\/strong> M\u1ee9c ph\u00ed d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t. Tuy nhi\u00ean, ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i. Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ea7n th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean ki\u1ec3m tra th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o trong m\u1ee5c <strong>Trung t\u00e2m Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n (Seller Center)<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 th\u00f4ng tin ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mz6Gd6aPzotBxyx2X3KlZqWkgWM\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng:<\/strong> Ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb <strong>4.0% \u0111\u1ebfn 12.0%<\/strong> t\u00f9y theo ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng. C\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c li\u1ec7t k\u00ea c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 s\u1ebd \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed m\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ecbnh l\u00e0 12.0%.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tqhpd5TTMofdC6xZJ18loveggmb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng TikTok Shop Mall:<\/strong> \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u01b0\u1edfng m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i h\u01a1n, dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb <strong>1.21% \u0111\u1ebfn 7.7%<\/strong> t\u00f9y theo ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LDPed82C0o08t9xxCgFlX0hFgSc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-FZuOdygLKoz9iQx0JJol9nmmgIh\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;24a9d3bf-c1bf-41dd-85a7-06024f464774&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYOT1b0TlVoUnzfxAuhxlFFE8gtf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YOT1b0TlVoUnzfxAuhxlFFE8gtf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:292755,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5432\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5432\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5432\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/d8414e68-b0af-4555-a7bd-88d5fdaba722.png\" alt=\"Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch TikTok Shop 2025\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/d8414e68-b0af-4555-a7bd-88d5fdaba722.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/d8414e68-b0af-4555-a7bd-88d5fdaba722-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/d8414e68-b0af-4555-a7bd-88d5fdaba722-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/d8414e68-b0af-4555-a7bd-88d5fdaba722-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/d8414e68-b0af-4555-a7bd-88d5fdaba722-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5432\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch TikTok Shop 2025<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WXRFdaqntoWDFoxraq9lvfT8gve\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ECYYdYGTIoyyFvxzufHlNvIGgCd\">M\u1ed9t lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed th\u1ee9 hai m\u00e0 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng hay kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u00fd khi kinh doanh tr\u00ean TikTok Shop \u0111\u00f3 l\u00e0 Ph\u00ed giao d\u1ecbch.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-Hx73dT3nYo6ihCxBMx3lHYbpgld\">Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V1FqddPSto6blrxQv3RlUHhOgNh\">Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch l\u00e0 kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed x\u1eed l\u00fd thanh to\u00e1n cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop. Kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thu \u0111\u1ec3 chi tr\u1ea3 cho c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c c\u1ed5ng thanh to\u00e1n, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o giao d\u1ecbch c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n an to\u00e0n v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-LD1sdcQ5xoYj9VxJ3fZlRrd4gW4\">C\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c t\u00ednh Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EPoldT48joGo76xo48Gl17KOgme\">Ph\u00ed n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh tr\u00ean t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n m\u00e0 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng thanh to\u00e1n cho \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, sau khi tr\u1eeb \u0111i c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0p6dK9xqoItnuxeXdmlRxOugaf\"><strong>C\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c: <\/strong>Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch = (S\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng thanh to\u00e1n &#8211; Ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n) x 5.0%<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOOwdQIB8oRd7ixb8W6l32O2gIW\">M\u1ee9c ph\u00ed giao d\u1ecbch hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i l\u00e0 <strong>5.0%<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4 ace-line old-record-id-JLhydZwJLom5raxTAj9l6fkPg6c\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5 minh h\u1ecda c\u00e1ch t\u00ednh<\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VuNCdmxNNoDgyHxVuOAlUOLmglh\">Gi\u1ea3 s\u1eed m\u1ed9t kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng mua m\u1ed9t \u0111\u00f4i gi\u00e0y v\u1edbi th\u00f4ng tin nh\u01b0 sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uv21dcVUno6YZ3xnWQvlS1apgvb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Gi\u00e1 ni\u00eam y\u1ebft: 300.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WZw8dL5RmoKlrFxJGyplQykxgud\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i c\u1ee7a Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng: 20.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I43gd9aUSo89hMxvBxdlwIWzg6g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n: 15.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gmzwd6ggRoQd3JxCuNJlkbBIgRh\">=&gt; <strong>S\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng thanh to\u00e1n<\/strong> = (300.000 &#8211; 20.000) + 15.000 = <strong>295.000 VN\u0110<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRIqdOH3toFtmtxgjkTlTfMMgub\"><strong>Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch<\/strong> s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh l\u00e0: 295.000 x 5.0% = <strong>14.750 VN\u0110<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YA2Jd3DLZotA1RxDHvsltHslgXb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yc3Nd4cljoJfWlxvkVYlkGyugGg\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2\">C\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed kh\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ea7n bi\u1ebft<\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EuqldYGrgoZf5hxcdZolo5Nkghg\">Ngo\u00e0i hai lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh tr\u00ean, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c chi ph\u00ed sau:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\">Ph\u00ed V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IV9WdR8KjoXektxhQiZlTFQngHd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-Qbspd2jpJoPQfmx6L9HlZaiagub\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5c31949a-40bd-4a7e-9b79-a9459e3304ed&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pl