quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FNvHXbSewLo4V7ExvivHlA9MsgDg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;NvHXbSewLo4V7ExvivHlA9MsgDg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:355621,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5435\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5435\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5435\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/04f19c14-d211-496c-ae00-51550d1032ac.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 ph\u00ed ph\u00e1t sinh kh\u00e1c\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/04f19c14-d211-496c-ae00-51550d1032ac.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/04f19c14-d211-496c-ae00-51550d1032ac-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/04f19c14-d211-496c-ae00-51550d1032ac-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/04f19c14-d211-496c-ae00-51550d1032ac-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/04f19c14-d211-496c-ae00-51550d1032ac-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5435\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>C\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh v\u00e0 ph\u00ed ph\u00e1t sinh kh\u00e1c<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q84IdGGklopE6SxmFxvl5vZhgwc\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D3AidohU0oOAjExrAD0lMOwPgNg\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed kh\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean, th\u01b0\u1eddng xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n khi c\u00f3 c\u00e1c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t ho\u1eb7c vi ph\u1ea1m t\u1eeb ph\u00eda nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 v\u00ed d\u1ee5 c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>Ph\u00ed ph\u1ea1t do vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh:<\/strong><\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X6Gad9475oZto7xwE93lhJgmgrd\">TikTok Shop c\u00f3 m\u1ed9t h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u0111i\u1ec3m ph\u1ea1t d\u00e0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n vi ph\u1ea1m c\u00e1c quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ec1 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh, b\u1ea1n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb \u0111i\u1ec3m uy t\u00edn m\u00e0 c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb ph\u1ea1t t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mc4gdqwIyolhIGxdwUYlENMzgid\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>V\u00ed d\u1ee5 1:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i sai tr\u1ecdng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m so v\u1edbi khai b\u00e1o ban \u0111\u1ea7u, d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u00eanh l\u1ec7ch ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n. TikTok Shop c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 truy thu ph\u1ea7n ch\u00eanh l\u1ec7ch n\u00e0y v\u00e0 tr\u1eeb tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u00e0o doanh thu c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QLsYdAMFpoLWl6xjcMclOy3CgMc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>V\u00ed d\u1ee5 2:<\/strong> T\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng do l\u1ed7i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n qu\u00e1 cao, ho\u1eb7c t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 giao h\u00e0ng tr\u1ec5 v\u01b0\u1ee3t m\u1ee9c cho ph\u00e9p. Trong nh\u1eefng tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p nghi\u00eam tr\u1ecdng, TikTok Shop c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c bi\u1ec7n ph\u00e1p ch\u1ebf t\u00e0i t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>Ph\u00ed \u0111\u1ec1n b\u00f9 cho tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ti\u00eau c\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng:<\/strong><\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R1LTdZLNmo8W7WxVpsIlsGWjgoh\">Khi l\u1ed7i xu\u1ea5t ph\u00e1t t\u1eeb ph\u00eda ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: giao sai s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ecb l\u1ed7i, thi\u1ebfu h\u00e0ng) g\u00e2y ra tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00f4ng t\u1ed1t cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, TikTok Shop c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 s\u1ebd b\u1ed3i th\u01b0\u1eddng cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng (b\u1eb1ng voucher ho\u1eb7c h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c kh\u00e1c) v\u00e0 sau \u0111\u00f3 kh\u1ea5u tr\u1eeb kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed n\u00e0y t\u1eeb t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>Chi ph\u00ed tham gia c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0110\u1ed3ng t\u00e0i tr\u1ee3 (Campaign Program):<\/strong><\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BOE3dCmYPoJN5FxXbF5lg7FigDb\">TikTok Shop th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean c\u00f3 c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 Flash Sale, Voucher Xtra (VXP) \u0111\u1ec3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1. \u0110\u1ec3 tham gia v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edfng c\u00e1c \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh n\u00e0y (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tr\u1ee3 gi\u00e1, nh\u1eadn th\u00eam voucher&#8230;), ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 c\u1ea7n ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 m\u1ed9t kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed tham gia. M\u1ee9c ph\u00ed n\u00e0y s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng trong \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh.<\/div>\n<h4 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>C\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh:<\/strong><\/h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XYsadToWmoBhJ6x232bldLP8gmg\">\u0110\u00f4i khi, trong sao k\u00ea doanh thu, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y c\u00e1c m\u1ee5c &#8220;\u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh&#8221;. \u0110\u00e2y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0 c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh do h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng t\u00ednh to\u00e1n sai s\u00f3t \u1edf k\u1ef3 tr\u01b0\u1edbc, ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n b\u1ed3i ho\u00e0n li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n khi c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 c\u1ed1 m\u1ea5t m\u00e1t, h\u01b0 h\u1ecfng h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KkxNd00Z5oIrylxmYCGlpP0WgsD\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2\">C\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c t\u00ednh t\u1ed5ng chi ph\u00ed tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng TikTok Shop<\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F9w6dyGYjofD2Rxm2jql9fJLgZe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-XvFyd6Vy5o0UtnxaVJBlNYsDgfd\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;fa9c5299-b66c-4175-babb-955f530a452d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCl5vbqB4moJzTRxotfalOUyLgZf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Cl5vbqB4moJzTRxotfalOUyLgZf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:243014,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5436\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5436\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5436\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/56e4a550-7b07-4fad-8562-8a687b4f706e.png\" alt=\"C\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c t\u00ednh t\u1ed5ng chi ph\u00ed tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng TikTok Shop\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/56e4a550-7b07-4fad-8562-8a687b4f706e.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/56e4a550-7b07-4fad-8562-8a687b4f706e-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/56e4a550-7b07-4fad-8562-8a687b4f706e-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/56e4a550-7b07-4fad-8562-8a687b4f706e-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/56e4a550-7b07-4fad-8562-8a687b4f706e-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5436\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>C\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c t\u00ednh t\u1ed5ng chi ph\u00ed tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng TikTok Shop<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PHpTdGCQko7l4JxEbtDlGb8Yg5f\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tc4PdZ1yeoGVpCxtISylWZcAg2g\">\u0110\u1ec3 t\u00ednh to\u00e1n l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n tr\u1eeb \u0111i t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c chi ph\u00ed t\u1eeb doanh thu. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c t\u1ed5ng qu\u00e1t:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SY7fds3vRoMcWjxoOetlDKqPgic\"><strong>T\u1ed5ng chi ph\u00ed ph\u1ea3i tr\u1ea3 = Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng + Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch + Ph\u00ed V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n (n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n t\u00e0i tr\u1ee3) + Ph\u00ed Affiliate (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3)<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IOpBdBUaBootgGxO7O8lkdFGg0K\"><strong>V\u00ed d\u1ee5 t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p:<\/strong> B\u1ea1n b\u00e1n m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u00e1o gi\u00e1 250.000 VN\u0110, thu\u1ed9c ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng th\u1eddi trang (ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng 10.0%) v\u00e0 c\u00f3 c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin sau:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGD3dCguaoGEfXx5kQ4lm701ggf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i c\u1ee7a Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng: 10.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A1BMdJTuOoIIcVxQNlKl6kKpgjc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n (kh\u00e1ch tr\u1ea3): 20.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VWlld0GAfostyjx3acblSuWcgad\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u00e1n qua Affiliate v\u1edbi hoa h\u1ed3ng 5%<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bp4odtMY3orXNYxdAdAlF408g9e\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng<\/strong> = (250.000 &#8211; 10.000) x 10% = 24.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QLE8dgUwjogX6AxLmublesczg4g\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n kh\u00e1ch thanh to\u00e1n<\/strong> = (250.000 &#8211; 10.000) + 20.000 = 260.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vs44dS4LToLT4yxxd8sluXWbgpc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch<\/strong> = 260.000 x 5.0% = 13.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FmwkdCv5soEdjoxhMOclJFEDgof\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Ph\u00ed Affiliate<\/strong> = (250.000 &#8211; 10.000) x 5% = 12.000 VN\u0110<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrpddypUIozYEfxi25ElFaeMgLm\">=&gt; <strong>T\u1ed5ng chi ph\u00ed<\/strong> = 24.000 + 13.000 + 12.000 = <strong>49.000 VN\u0110<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TwFddOph3oVXfxx9CbKlJNQ0gJb\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WcVBdBZEpoi4bJxmMw2ltfYygS7\" start=\"4\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2\">C\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p v\u1ec1 ph\u00ed s\u00e0n TikTok<\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>Xem chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb \u1edf \u0111\u00e2u?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WcFQdGoTnoXI5KxejCGlQp2Yg0d\">\u0110\u1ec3 xem chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i so\u00e1t t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb tr\u00ean m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o <strong>Trung t\u00e2m Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n (Seller Center)<\/strong> c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh minh b\u1ea1ch v\u00e0 chi ti\u1ebft nh\u1ea5t d\u00e0nh cho b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HmUwdZkNpon1zhxx65Qldo6sgRb\">H\u00e3y l\u00e0m theo c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc sau:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CvRPdaGqBopALmxcCp6llt5ZgIg\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o Trung t\u00e2m Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n (Seller Center)<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hfocd1EGdobBpxxU9eCl3oQhgI0\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Truy c\u1eadp trang web <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/seller-vn.tiktok.com\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/seller-vn.tiktok.com\/<\/a><\/strong> v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PaTDd86uPoBNVDxHXIQlNHlbgVe\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Truy c\u1eadp m\u1ee5c &#8220;T\u00e0i ch\u00ednh&#8221; (Finance)<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EeHwd5yTAoY6bHxunwDlS0zXgSh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Tr\u00ean thanh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 b\u00ean tay tr\u00e1i, t\u00ecm v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o m\u1ee5c <strong>&#8220;T\u00e0i ch\u00ednh&#8221;<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GN0pdjN9fo1ULdxCbxTlyAv2gPf\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 c\u00e1c b\u00e1o c\u00e1o chi ti\u1ebft<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L0DLd9qrloXcUrxvl02lXnYkgLe\">Trong m\u1ee5c &#8220;T\u00e0i ch\u00ednh&#8221;, c\u00f3 hai khu v\u1ef1c quan tr\u1ecdng b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n ch\u00fa \u00fd:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wt5mdJX7joTdmRxbzzTldsCEgef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>M\u1ee5c &#8220;Giao d\u1ecbch&#8221; (Transactions):<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SchnduHx2oklYXxSFu3lIAeLghd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 n\u01a1i hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c giao d\u1ecbch t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh ph\u00e1t sinh g\u1ea7n nh\u01b0 theo th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IjA9d9dVKouWkGxr7k9l1azJg9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u1ecdc theo t\u1eebng m\u00e3 \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 xem nhanh doanh thu t\u1ea1m t\u00ednh v\u00e0 c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed t\u1ea1m t\u00ednh b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb cho \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00f3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LLAkdI7ZToLqvoxn3rallXA6gvh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>M\u1ee5c n\u00e0y ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 ki\u1ec3m tra nhanh m\u1ed9t \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EcQtdvwaXoFdvnxndtjlhIR4gkh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>M\u1ee5c &#8220;H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 quy\u1ebft to\u00e1n&#8221; (Settlements):<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WJctdxjrXoKoiYxFHESlKq93g8g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 n\u01a1i quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed1i so\u00e1t t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c. C\u00e1c &#8220;h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 quy\u1ebft to\u00e1n&#8221; l\u00e0 c\u00e1c b\u1ea3n sao k\u00ea \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ed1t l\u1ea1i theo m\u1ed9t chu k\u1ef3 nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh (th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0y) sau khi c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KkYPdR8qmo60Nexsb63lpk4kgQd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Khi nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o m\u1ed9t h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 quy\u1ebft to\u00e1n, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3ng b\u00e1o c\u00e1o c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 chi ti\u1ebft, bao g\u1ed3m:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IqAndFJluoQfgTxfBtTlHjDQgAg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T\u1ed5ng doanh thu<\/strong> c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng trong k\u1ef3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QqJgd8LWYo9p2IxH8gElMHFvg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed b\u1ecb tr\u1eeb:<\/strong> S\u1ebd c\u00f3 c\u00e1c c\u1ed9t ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t cho t\u1eebng lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed nh\u01b0 Ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng, Ph\u00ed giao d\u1ecbch, Ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, Ph\u00ed Ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft (Affiliate), v\u00e0 c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n \u0110i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EgmUd216Ook3Bnx6qHalls6nggc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>S\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n th\u1ef1c nh\u1eadn cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng<\/strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n v\u00e0o S\u1ed1 d\u01b0 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YYVVdVtAmoX8BTxu1TmlBpWwg7g\"><strong>M\u1eb9o h\u1eefu \u00edch:<\/strong> T\u1ea1i m\u1ee5c &#8220;H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 quy\u1ebft to\u00e1n&#8221;, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 <strong>xu\u1ea5t (export)<\/strong> c\u00e1c b\u00e1o c\u00e1o n\u00e0y ra file Excel. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y r\u1ea5t ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i cho vi\u1ec7c l\u01b0u tr\u1eef s\u1ed5 s\u00e1ch, t\u1ef1 t\u00ednh to\u00e1n l\u1ea1i l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 cho c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c k\u1ebf to\u00e1n sau n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>C\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 bao g\u1ed3m thu\u1ebf (VAT) ch\u01b0a?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CrWldnr8Bo1i2PxIesdlgLySgdc\">Theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh, c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng N\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng v\u00e0 Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch m\u00e0 TikTok Shop c\u00f4ng b\u1ed1 <strong>\u0111\u00e3 bao g\u1ed3m thu\u1ebf (VAT)<\/strong>. Tuy nhi\u00ean, n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd M\u00e3 s\u1ed1 thu\u1ebf (MST) v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e3 cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin n\u00e0y cho TikTok Shop, n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng s\u1ebd ch\u1ec9 thu kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed ch\u01b0a bao g\u1ed3m thu\u1ebf, v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u00f3 tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m k\u00ea khai v\u00e0 n\u1ed9p thu\u1ebf theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y\/ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n c\u00f3 b\u1ecb t\u00ednh ph\u00ed kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RtQod67ljoh7ZNx97QAl85NTgmc\">Kh\u00f4ng. C\u1ea3 Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh tr\u00ean c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c giao th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng v\u00e0 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng b\u1ecb h\u1ee7y ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua ho\u00e0n tr\u1ea3 to\u00e0n b\u1ed9, c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed \u0111\u00e3 thu s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n l\u1ea1i cho nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z6NsdO9ecotBxHxnOAFlTGdHgc2\">Vi\u1ec7c n\u1eafm r\u00f5 c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed s\u00e0n l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gi\u00e1 c\u1ea1nh tranh tr\u00ean TikTok Shop. B\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 c\u00e1ch t\u00ednh Ph\u00ed Hoa h\u1ed3ng, Ph\u00ed Giao d\u1ecbch v\u00e0 c\u00e1c chi ph\u00ed li\u00ean quan kh\u00e1c, nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 tin qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u00e0i ch\u00ednh v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0a ra c\u00e1c quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh kinh doanh s\u00e1ng su\u1ed1t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8aJdORn3ofoWQx0te9lUoXrgQe\">Hi\u1ec3u v\u1ec1 chi ph\u00ed l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng, nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 b\u1ee9t ph\u00e1 v\u00e0 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n h\u01a1n, t\u1eeb t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a gian h\u00e0ng, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung, \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u01b0a gian h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh l\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1ea7m cao m\u1edbi, h\u00e3y t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia t\u1ea1i Lemon Digital n\u01a1i cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n chinh ph\u1ee5c th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GpJUdiImcorpnTx2Qt0lysVSgtg\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IJQqdgg4foKHaKxqb8wlkm0Ngsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 